  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSpace, Style & Convenience at Eight Lake Pupuke\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for an apartment that offers more than just a place to live, this is an opportunity worth your attention.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the penthouse level of Eight Lake Pupuke, this appealing residence combines two bedrooms, two bathrooms, a separate study and the rare bonus of two car parks plus a dedicated storage locker. Add a lovely balcony with pleasant town views, and you have a home that balances everyday practicality with an enjoyable urban lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe elevated position brings a sense of privacy and openness, while the balcony provides a welcoming spot to enjoy your morning coffee, unwind at the end of the day or entertain friends against the Takapuna townscape.\r\n\r\nInside, the flexible layout caters to a variety of lifestyles. The separate study is ideal for working from home, managing personal affairs or creating an additional retreat, while two bathrooms provide comfort and convenience for residents and guests alike. Whether you are a professional couple, a small family or looking to downsize without giving up valuable space and parking, this apartment deserves a closer look.\r\n\r\nContemporary Design with a Story\r\n\r\nDeveloped by respected New Zealand property company Willis Bond, Eight Lake Pupuke is a boutique residential development comprising 54 apartments across two mid-rise buildings, completed around 2018–2019.\r\n\r\nThe project brought together AECOM as architect and Haydn & Rollett for project management and construction, combining contemporary architectural design with the practical demands of building on a challenging site.\r\nThe result is a residential address that combines contemporary design with the convenience of an established North Shore location.\r\n\r\nTakapuna on Your Doorstep\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Takapuna's relaxed coastal atmosphere and vibrant town centre. Cafés, restaurants, shops and supermarkets are close by, while Takapuna Beach and Lake Pupuke offer wonderful options for a morning walk, outdoor recreation or simply enjoying the surroundings.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the desirable school zones, including Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls' High School and Takapuna Grammar School. These schooling options add further appeal for families planning ahead for their children's education. School zoning should be independently confirmed for the property address.\r\n\r\nWith public transport and motorway connections within easy reach, getting around the North Shore and travelling into Auckland is straightforward.\r\n\r\nA Genuine Opportunity for Downsizers\r\n\r\nThe current owner is downsizing and is highly motivated to sell, presenting an excellent opportunity for buyers ready to make their next move.\r\n\r\nPenthouse-level positioning, a flexible two-bedroom-plus-study layout, two bathrooms, two car parks and extra storage make this a particularly practical package in a location that continues to attract buyers seeking convenience and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity to secure your place at Eight Lake Pupuke. Contact us today to arrange your viewing.",
